  "description": "Ever heard of an “alpha mate” before? It’s someone who’s paid to be an alpha’s sexual plaything during their rut. Or a person who’s used by a non-alpha who wants to present as an alpha. Which is why Se-Jun is not at all pleased when his childhood crush, Yeon-Woo, is brought in as his alpha mate in the hopes of turning Se-Jun into a true alpha. Here’s a secret: Se-Jun is already an alpha. With a contract between them and a secret that Se-Jun is determined to keep, will these two be able to make a true connection? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
